{"4951430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lamplight", "steam_appid": 4951430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lamplight is a deckbuilding turn based roguelike RPG set in Victorian era England. Through some dark magic Dracula has plunged all of the British Isles into a magical darkness known as the gloom. Another force known as the Midnight Lantern has recruited four extraordinary gentlemen to defeat the Count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains 60+ unique cards, 15+ unique enemies and 3 distinct areas. Its playable characters include Jonathan Harker, Victor Frankenstein, Henry Jekyll/Edward Hyde and Dorian Gray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lamplight is a deckbuilding turn based roguelike RPG set in Victorian era England. Through some dark magic Dracula has plunged all of the British Isles into a magical darkness known as the gloom. Another force known as the Midnight Lantern has recruited four extraordinary gentlemen to defeat the Count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains 60+ unique cards, 15+ unique enemies and 3 distinct areas. Its playable characters include Jonathan Harker, Victor Frankenstein, Henry Jekyll/Edward Hyde and Dorian Gray. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lamplight is a deckbuilding turn based roguelike RPG set in Victorian era England. Van Helsing is dead, Dracula has cloaked the old world in darkness, there is only one hope that remains. Take control of one of four characters from classical gothic literature and fight to kill him once and for all.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4951430/a6245a0944c7086d5629aab316a49fc3a9e77937/header.jpg?t=1787322703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.